      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/COLLECTIE_TROPENMUSEUM_Djatihoutvlotten_in_de_Solo-rivier_Res._Rembang_Java_TMnr_10013201.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
